## Command

```shell
biome lint --only=style/useFilenamingConvention FooBar.vue BarBaz.astro Exported.vue OnlyExpressions.vue
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "html": {
    "experimentalFullSupportEnabled": true,
    "linter": { "enabled": true }
  },
  "linter": {
    "rules": {
      "preset": "none",
      "style": { "useFilenamingConvention": "error" }
    }
  }
}
```

## `BarBaz.astro`

```astro
---
const a = 1;
---
<span>{a}</span>
<span>{a}</span>
<span>{a}</span>

```

## `Exported.vue`

```vue
<template>
  <span>{{ Exported }}</span>
</template>

<script>
export const Exported = 1;
</script>

```

## `FooBar.vue`

```vue
<script setup>
const a = 1;
</script>

<template>
  <span>{{ a }}</span>
  <span>{{ a }}</span>
  <span>{{ a }}</span>
</template>

```

## `OnlyExpressions.vue`

```vue
<template>
  <span>{{ first }}</span>
  <span>{{ second }}</span>
  <span>{{ third }}</span>
</template>

```

